{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13471","headline":"蝉鸣一篇五章 五 · 宋华","name":"蝉鸣一篇五章 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岁之秋深，蝉其夕吟。\n披衣轩除，萧萧风林。\n我友来斯，言告离衿。\n何以叙怀，临水鸣琴。\n何以赠言，委顺浮沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13471.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13471","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}